<title>BRAZIL: Brazil's Cenbank sets dlr buy/sell auction.</title>
<headline>Brazil's Cenbank sets dlr buy/sell auction.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's Central Bank announced a dollar auction requiring buy and sell offers in the commercial foreign exchange market, dealers said.</p>
<p>Before the auction, the real was asked at 1.0623 per dollar and bid at 1.0625 per dollar, they added.</p>
<p>((-- Alexandre Caverni, Sao Paulo newsroom, 5511 248 5418))</p>
</text>
